{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["I will advise you — advice to bring about their downfall, in my judgment." "What this people will do to your people in the end of days — but now, soon, in your lifetime, you need not fear them. And this is the advice: ״הן הנה היו לבני ישראל בדבר בלעם״ וגו׳ — and here Moshe left the advice undisclosed, because Balaam said it secretly to Balak, and the advice was not known until Moshe spelled it out at the point of need."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:50:55.456664052Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}